# Spark IDE - proven ide buffer bind (-> dump) + print op JSON.
# After key-bad. Like run/new bind, buffer bind stores op JSON;
# print dump shows that JSON (body dumps to arrow, not the bind).
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_buffer_bind.spark
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven bind only.

ide open "examples/hello.spark"

ide buffer -> dump

print dump
